---
system: sys-03-device-runtime-local-interaction
flow_id: boot
surface: device
spec_anchor: /software/systems/03-device-runtime-local-interaction#boot-sequence
actors: [Hardware, Bootloader, RuntimeApp, ConfigService, RealtimeService]
apis:
  - GET /v1/device/config
  - GET /v1/realtime/connect
externals: []
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - firmware_signature_invalid
  - repeated_boot_crash
  - config_apply_failed
  - wifi_unavailable
idempotency: boot_count NVS counter monotonic — boot_fail_window tracks repeated failure
retry: bootloader will retry signature verify; runtime app retries Wi-Fi/WS with exponential backoff
timeout: 30s p99 from power-on to IDLE_READY
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED. Adapted from sys-03 §14 Phase A.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Hardware
    participant Bootloader
    participant RuntimeApp
    participant ConfigService
    participant RealtimeService

    Hardware->>Bootloader: power on / reset
    alt firmware_signature_invalid
        Bootloader-->>Hardware: refuse to launch, fallback to safe slot or halt
    else success
        Bootloader->>Bootloader: verify firmware signature (ECDSA P-256 with factory-embedded key)
        Bootloader->>RuntimeApp: launch application (state=BOOTING)
    end

    RuntimeApp->>RuntimeApp: mount NVS, load sys.last_config_etag, read boot_fail_window
    alt repeated_boot_crash (boot_fail_window >= 3)
        RuntimeApp->>RuntimeApp: skip normal startup → state=SAFE_MODE (display support code, allow heartbeat + diagnostics only)
    else success
        RuntimeApp->>RuntimeApp: init RTOS tasks (audio, network, supervisor at priority 24)
        RuntimeApp->>RuntimeApp: init audio pipeline (DMA buffers, ring buffers)
    end

    RuntimeApp->>RuntimeApp: connect Wi-Fi
    alt wifi_unavailable
        RuntimeApp->>RuntimeApp: state=OFFLINE_LIMITED, schedule reconnect (exponential 2s→5m)
    else success
        RuntimeApp->>ConfigService: GET /v1/device/config (Authorization: DeviceBearer, If-None-Match: sys.last_config_etag)
        alt config_apply_failed (E-CFG-422)
            ConfigService-->>RuntimeApp: 200 payload that fails schema validation
            RuntimeApp->>RuntimeApp: reject, keep previous config, emit fault E-CFG-422
        else 304 Not Modified
            ConfigService-->>RuntimeApp: 304 (update sys.last_heartbeat_at only)
        else success
            ConfigService-->>RuntimeApp: 200 {configVersion, etag, interactionPolicy, …}
            RuntimeApp->>RuntimeApp: persist nvs_policy, publish CONFIG_APPLIED event
        end

        RuntimeApp->>RealtimeService: WS GET /v1/realtime/connect?device_id&session_token
        RealtimeService-->>RuntimeApp: 101 session ready
        RuntimeApp->>RuntimeApp: play ready chime, state=IDLE_READY
    end

    Note over Hardware,RealtimeService: timeout 30s p99 · safe-mode triggers on boot_fail_window>=3 in 15min · last_boot_reason enum logged for support diagnostics
